# Names only. Values live in your OS keychain (QuestiVibe 비밀값 탭) and in Railway variables, never in this file.
#
# AI: put ONE of these in the 비밀값 tab to turn the AI features on. Without any, the rest of the app still works.
# (They are commented out on purpose: none of them is required.)
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
#
# Public demo only (leave unset on your own computer):
# DEMO_MODE=1          every visitor gets a space of their own (cookie), cleared after 3 idle days
# AI_DAILY_LIMIT=      AI uses per day for the whole demo; unset or 0 = AI off on the demo
